     6677                                 no-lock
     6678               break
     6679                   by ub.gds-season.gds-code  by goods.grp-name
     6680                   with FRAME Zapas :
     6681                IF first-of(ub.gds-season.gds-code) then DO:
     6682                   assign
     6683                     f-qnty         = 0
     6684                     f-cost-sum     = 0
     6685                     f-sale-sum     = 0
     6686                     f-sale-other   = 0
