     6704                             ub.ot-line.sum-type = 'crsa':U OR
     6705                             ub.ot-line.sum-type = 'cost':U ) no-lock :
     6706                       run in-proc in this-procedure .
     6707                 End.
     6708               End.
     6709             if last-of(ub.gds-season.gds-code) then DO:
     6710             run last-of-artic in this-procedure .
