     8398             excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-sale-other    )   CHR(9)
     8399             excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-crsa-sum      )   CHR(9)
     8400             excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-qnty-all      )   CHR(9)
     8401             excel-sum (accum TOTAL f-cost-sum-all  )   CHR(9)
